<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερο-μηϝία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sacred month</i>, during which the great festivals were
			held and hostilities suspended, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ.
			Νεμεάς</span>, of the Nemean games, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. ἁ Πυθιάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1126.44
				</span></i>
			 (Amphict.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν σπονδαῖς καὶ προσέτι ἱερομηνία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.56
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν σπονδαῖς καὶ
			ἱερομηνίαις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				65
			</span></i> (s. v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. ἄγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.29
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i>sacrifices offered during the sacred month,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).154.11
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); = Lat.
				<i>supplicatio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.130
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				39.53
			</span></i> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερο-μήνια</span></b> , τά, of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρνεια</span> (q.v.), is prob. f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.54
			</span></i>).</div>
